  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_f8eee7b4d94d405e8ae1cd7638c1d8cf",
      "statement": "ZeroHubClient.reconnect handles the 1001 going-away redirect case (newHost argument) before falling back to host failover: the close reason is validated as a well-formed host via isWellFormedHost (client/src/utils.ts, mirroring the server's validateBackupHost); a malformed reason logs a warning and falls through to the automatic host-failover path without touching host state; a redirect equal to this.host (self-redirect) surfaces onZeroHubError and stops; a valid redirect updates this.host and hostIndex (pointing at the redirected host when it is in the configured list) before calling connectToZeroHub. For the host-failover path (no newHost), reconnect re-checks the isDisconnected flag inside the async getZeroHubBackupHost().then callback (not just at entry) so a disconnect() called while the backup-host fetch is in flight does not resurrect the connection, and aborts if the backup host equals the current host.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://client/src/zeroHub.ts#L288-L380",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e652757e5757dce0f9ffe558e27c3c8a2eff0f1c50e19cc1491d09c9bfa7a1b8:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_4b0dc7e91368409180c96e9a923cf9e7",
      "statement": "ZeroHubClient.disconnect() sets isDisconnected, clears pending ICE timeouts, calls the shared closeActiveSocket() helper (which detaches onclose/onerror/onmessage/onopen and closes the socket with code 1000 so onclose does not auto-reconnect), then transitions every peer to Disconnected and closes each RTCPeerConnection via removePeer, emptying the peers map; the client is reusable afterwards. connectToZeroHub also calls closeActiveSocket() at the top to tear down any socket left open by a previous entry-point call without going through disconnect(), nulling handlers first so the replaced socket does not fire reconnect() (which would advance hostIndex a second time for a single logical failure) or onZeroHubError.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://client/src/zeroHub.ts#L618-L629",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:0f9b8246a41893c3af6043a7d7529ebfce115acbf7614b50da89621fe6b49b81:"
        },
        {
